{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
dsbmd will not mount removable media automatically until its rc.d
service is enabled. To enable it, add the following to /etc/rc.conf:

  dsbmd_enable="YES"

Then start it with:

  service dsbmd start

Until this is done, dsbmc/dsbmc-cli will fail with an error such as:

  uconnect(/var/run/dsbmd.socket): No such file or directory
EOM
}
